      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           BEECHTREE LANE                                                  (west side) 9/254                                            Barn and cowshed                                                  immediately SW of Westwick                                                  Hall GV                                               II Barn and cowshed.   Late C17 or early C18.   Timber frame. Weatherboarding.   Plain tile roof.   The barn is 5 bays with clasped purlin roof and tall flint and brick base.  C19 slate- roof, lean-to additions on S side, cowshed on right is lower and 3 bays.  Similar construction. Listing NGR: TL1037806790"
